This repository includes files derived from Herdr (https://herdr.dev), which is
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

- mods/space-folders/main.js is a modified copy of Herdr's `spaces` mod
  (version 0.1.16). It adds folders to the sidebar.
- mods/agents-unread/main.js is a modified copy of Herdr's `agents` mod
  (version 0.1.16). It lets an idle agent be marked unread.
- layouts/main-folders.json is a modified copy of Herdr's `main` layout
  (version 0.1.16). Its Spaces block shows `space-folders` instead of `spaces`,
  and its Agents block shows `agents-unread` instead of `agents`.
